                                <tr><td class="guide-table__key"><a href="https://www.datadoghq.com/pricing/?product=infrastructure" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Datadog</a></td><td><span class="kind-badge" style={`--kind: ${kinds.agent.color}`}>Agent</span> with a hosted backend</td><td>Paid: Infrastructure Pro $15 per host per month, billed annually; free up to 5 hosts with 1-day retention</td><td>You want nothing to host and per-host pricing fits your fleet</td></tr>
                                <tr><td class="guide-table__key"><a href="https://www.nagios.com/products/nagios-xi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nagios</a></td><td><span class="kind-badge" style={`--kind: ${kinds.poller.color}`}>Poller</span> with plugins; NRPE and NCPA agents optional</td><td>Nagios Core free (GPL v2); Nagios XI from $2,595 for 100 nodes, one-time</td><td>You need up/down checks and its large plugin library</td></tr>
