                        <li><a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/tree/main/receiver/hostmetricsreceiver" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenTelemetry Collector Contrib: Host Metrics receiver</a></li>
